考虑逻辑回归模型，并假定$\beta=0$.
\begin{enumerate}[label=(\alph*)]
\item\label{item:12.20.a} 若$0<\sum_{i=1}^ny_i<n$，证明$\pi(x)$的MLE为$\hat\pi=\sum_{i=1}^ny_i/n$，此时它不依赖$x$.
