$$\sum_{i=1}^{k^*}|x_{(i)}|\le\sum_{i=k^*+1}^n|x_{(i)}|\quad\text{和}\quad
\sum_{i=1}^{k^*+1}|x_{(i)}|>\sum_{i=k^*+2}^n|x_{(i)}|.$$
